    "description": "Best AI Video Generator for talking videos! With AI Script, AI Voice, and AI Avatars, you can generate professional podcast videos. \r\nBecome a social media influencer no editing experience is required! Wondershare Virbo is the perfect tool for YouTubers, vloggers, educators, and anyone looking to create compelling videos quickly and effortlessly. \r\n\r\nKey Features: \r\n\r\nAI Photo Animator: Talking Photos\r\n- Bring Photos to Life: Simply import, export, and transform your photos into talking masterpieces.\r\n- Accommodates various languages, enabling you to reach a diverse global audience.\r\n- Versatile Audio Options: Choose from online recording, local upload, or voice extraction to customize your talking photos.\r\n\r\nAI Voiceover\uff1a\r\n- AI Text-to-Speech converts text into natural-sounding spoken audio.\r\n- 300+ AI voices with diverse languages, accents, and tones. Pick from various male/female voices and age groups to fit your preferences.\r\n- Supports multiple languages and dialects, including English, Spanish, Chinese, etc.\r\n\r\n300+ AI Avatars:\r\n- AI-Powered Realism: Generate stunningly realistic avatars using state-of-the-art AI algorithms.\r\n- Over 300 Avatar: Covering various ethnicities and regions from around the globe\r\n- Affordable, Time-saving AI-created videos: No need for actual models or photography significantly reducing production costs and time\r\n\r\nAuto Captions\r\n- Supports various file types and languages.\r\n- Stylish Captions & Subtitles for Videos.\r\n- Auto Speech-to-Text: AI automatic axis alignment\r\n\r\nText to Video: \r\n- Convert your text into dynamic videos with just a few clicks.\r\n- Personalize your videos with various templates, fonts, and styles to match your creative vision.\r\n- Create videos in multiple languages, reaching a diverse global audience.\r\n- Easy Sharing: Share your text-based videos directly from the app on social media platforms or with friends and family.\r\n\r\n300+ Professional Templates: \r\n- Customize expertly designed templates to align with your brand identity and industry requirements.\r\n\r\nAI Script: \r\n- Utilize the power of AI to generate captivating video scripts that hold your viewers' attention.\r\n\r\n100% Royalty-free Stock Music: \r\n- Elevate your videos with an extensive library of royalty-free music, encompassing a variety of genres and moods.\r\n\r\nAI Video Translator: Translate videos into multiple languages \r\n- Support English, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Russian, French, Portuguese, German, Italian, Arabic and more.\r\n- Distinct Voice Tones: Supports multiple voice tones in different languages\r\n- Automatic Subtitle Generation\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Virbo?\r\n- Time-saving: \r\nCreate high-quality videos in a fraction of the time it takes using traditional methods.\r\n- Cost-effective: \r\nEliminate the need for expensive equipment, actors, and locations, and invest your resources more wisely.\r\n- Versatile: \r\nVirbo is perfect for social media video production, marketing, product demonstrations, brand promotion, online education, learning and training, and more!\r\n- Accessible: \r\nWith Virbo, anyone can create professional-grade videos, regardless of their technical expertise or experience in video production.\r\n- Secure\r\nSafeguard your privacy by using a virtual avatar instead of appearing in person, ensuring your personal information and appearance remain secure\r\n\r\nSay goodbye to cameras, microphones, and actors. Download Virbo today and revolutionize your video creation process with the power of advanced AI technology!\r\n\r\nYou can find privacy policy and terms & conditions from the following links:\r\nhttps://virbo.wondershare.com/privacy.html\r\nhttps://virbo.wondershare.com/end-user-license-agreement.html",
